WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.101
Compare living things and ways people depend on them

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.327
Germination: the early growth of a seed into a seedling. Habitat: the natural place

00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:10.792
where an organism lives.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:17.281
Food chain: the path of food energy from one living thing to another. Biodiversity:

00:00:17.281 --> 00:00:22.540
the variety of living things in an area. Conservation: protecting plants, animals and

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:22.945
habitats.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:28.327
Observe a plant for a week and draw a simple food chain without harming animals.
